#### [MODIFY] [GPIO.md](file:///c:/Users/oml/Documents/BitBucket/MOT/Docs/Fundamentals/GPIO.md)

Full rewrite (~300 lines):
- GPIO concept: digital pin that can be input or output
- Output modes: push-pull (two transistors, drives high AND low), open-drain
- Input modes: floating, pull-up, pull-down, analog
